 "notes": "FY2026 10-K filed 2026-07-29; all three years taken from its Note 18. Restatement: Microsoft recast its segments in August 2024 (Microsoft 365 Commercial incl. Windows Commercial moved into Productivity and Business Processes, among other changes). The FY2024 10-K originally reported FY2024 revenue P&BP 77,728 / IC 105,362 / MPC 62,032 and operating income 40,540 / 49,584 / 19,309; restated values used here are 106,820 / 87,464 / 50,838 and 59,661 / 37,813 / 11,959 (totals unchanged at 245,122 and 109,433). FY2024 and FY2025 figures in the FY2026 10-K match those in the FY2025 10-K (no further recast). Microsoft allocates corporate costs to segments, so the 'other' line is zero. In FY2026 some lines were renamed (Gaming -> XBOX, Search and news advertising -> Search advertising, Nuance Healthcare -> Health and Life Sciences cloud). Segment arithmetic checks exactly."
